{"thread":{"threadID":4896,"boardID":117,"topic":"Team News - 26.10.2017","time":1509032156,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1509116945,"lastPoster":"Ecoplox","replies":21,"views":670,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":8},"tags":[{"tagID":9,"name":"admin"},{"tagID":880,"name":"admin+"},{"tagID":70,"name":"dream"},{"tagID":1186,"name":"Luckiris"},{"tagID":23,"name":"news"},{"tagID":47,"name":"team"},{"tagID":597,"name":"Teamspeak"},{"tagID":12,"name":"test"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"},{"tagID":931,"name":"uprank"},{"tagID":1267,"name":"winnie"}],"posts":[{"postID":73087,"threadID":4896,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Team News - 26.10.2017","time":1509032156,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509032309,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1509036249,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1509040806,"value":1},{"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","time":1509042782,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1509043993,"value":1},{"userID":2648,"username":"Winnie","time":1509050954,"value":1},{"userID":2611,"username":"FantasyGamer29","time":1509053612,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1509102990,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Winnie hat seine</strong><strong> Test-Admin</strong><strong> Zeit ️</strong><strong>bestanden</strong><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p>Nach anderthalb Monaten hat <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2648-winnie/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Winnie</a> seine Testzeit bestanden und kann sich jetzt einen Administrator nennen. Durch sein Alter, Reife und vorherige Erfahrung mit der administrativen Position sollte es ihm nicht schwer gefallen sein, die Testzeit ohne größere Schwierigkeiten zu überstehen. Es gab beinahe keine Beschwerden über ihn, und <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/4808-beschwerde-gegen-winnie-timo-demo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">sollte es doch eine geben</a>, so bewies er, dass er für diese Position mehr als genug qualifiziert ist. Seine Aktivität auf dem Gameserver und TeamSpeak ist auch sehr gut, weshalb nichts gegen den Uprank spricht.</p>\n<p><br></p></div><p>Herzlichen Glückwunsch! Bitte kontaktier mich um einen weiteren Server zu erhalten.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>Luckiris received an uprank from an Administrator to an Administrator+</strong><br></p>\n<div class=\"message-align\"><p><a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a> has been upranked yesterday due to incredible motivation and commitment for the Dream Community. The uprank from Admin to Admin+ came very quickly, it took Luckiris less then two months. He is showing real dedication, which is something people could learn from him. Most people probably won&#x27;t realize, how much work Luckiris is currently putting into the community, mainly because he was doing some things for the Adminteam and some behind the scenes things, which you may or may not notice on the servers. He has been coding a lot of plugins for Dream, which either bring new features for the server or just improve quality of life. For example, he is currently developing some new items for the T-Shop on TTT, which will be coming in the next few days. Furthermore, he has an impressive amount of hours on our servers, in fact, according to Player Analytics, he is the #1 player of all time in terms of hours played. This really shows how much he cares for the community and that should be rewarded.</p>\n<p><br></p></div><p>Congratulations <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a>! I hope that you will continue to stay this dedicated, who knows how far you can go <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73088,"threadID":4896,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1509033547,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037242,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Glückwunsch an beide</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73089,"threadID":4896,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1509033792,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037245,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Good job</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73090,"threadID":4896,"userID":2375,"username":"<<<","subject":"","time":1509034105,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037247,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gz jüngs</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>deserved af luckiris <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73091,"threadID":4896,"userID":2547,"username":"Perks","subject":"","time":1509034356,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037248,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Congratulation to both of you</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73092,"threadID":4896,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1509035184,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037250,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Congratulations to both of you guys, especially <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2369-luckiris/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Luckiris</a> for the incredible work you put into the community my friend we all appreciate the work you do for the community and hope you will stay with us for a very very long time.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong><em><u>Congratulations Luckiris und Winnie</u></em></strong></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73093,"threadID":4896,"userID":2368,"username":"Helimir","subject":"","time":1509036541,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509037257,"value":1},{"userID":2648,"username":"Winnie","time":1509050920,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>find ich lit beide verdient gute arbeit</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73095,"threadID":4896,"userID":8,"username":"laduck","subject":"","time":1509038151,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509038391,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[like*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73096,"threadID":4896,"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","subject":"","time":1509038719,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509039229,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>gz</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":73097,"threadID":4896,"userID":2576,"username":"TimeShot","subject":"","time":1509038887,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1509039232,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gute Arbeit <a href=\"https://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2648-winnie/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Winnie</a> der Bär<br>and Good Job <a href=\"https://dre